00:04:12.620 --> 00:04:14.344
- Mmmm.

00:04:18.113 --> 00:04:19.834
I deal with them the same way I deal with

00:04:19.834 --> 00:04:21.559
any kind of employee.

00:04:21.559 --> 00:04:24.435
Super hard worker, but maybe
slightly under-talented.

00:04:24.435 --> 00:04:27.880
In between on both fronts.

00:04:27.880 --> 00:04:30.988
Every situation in life,
let alone employees,

00:04:30.988 --> 00:04:33.561
only can be solved when
you believe there's issues,

00:04:33.561 --> 00:04:37.577
and you have the luxury
and the responsibility.

00:04:37.577 --> 00:04:38.897
And let me say that one more time,

00:04:38.897 --> 00:04:41.644
when you have the luxury
and the responsibility

00:04:41.644 --> 00:04:43.711
of being the judge and the jury.

00:04:43.711 --> 00:04:45.949
The pressure and the onus is on you.

00:04:45.949 --> 00:04:48.780
I truly, truly, truly believe
that if there's an employee

00:04:48.780 --> 00:04:51.510
at Vayner Media, and
there are some, plenty,

00:04:51.510 --> 00:04:52.966
no, not plenty, that's not fair,

00:04:52.966 --> 00:04:54.927
