00:04:54.927 --> 00:04:56.937
and are under-performing,
that it's my fault.

00:04:56.937 --> 00:04:58.631
We haven't created the infrastructure

00:04:58.631 --> 00:05:00.836
for allowing them to shine.

00:05:00.836 --> 00:05:03.496
Their bosses are not clicking with them,

00:05:03.496 --> 00:05:05.177
