00:05:24.339 --> 00:05:26.827
There's so much serendipity,
different bosses that you get,

00:05:26.827 --> 00:05:29.434
people move around, team
mates, things of that nature.

00:05:29.434 --> 00:05:31.998
And so, you know, I think
the way I deal with it

00:05:31.998 --> 00:05:33.252
is communication.

00:05:33.252 --> 00:05:34.672
You know, I have a full slate today,

00:05:34.672 --> 00:05:36.175
it's the last kind of in-the-office day,

00:05:36.175 --> 00:05:37.774
I have a lot of meetings
I'm trying to get in.

00:05:37.774 --> 00:05:40.962
10, five, 10, 10, five,
10 minute meetings.

00:05:40.962 --> 00:05:43.205
And a lot of the conversation
will be around that.

00:05:43.205 --> 00:05:44.959
And so I think it's communication.

00:05:44.959 --> 00:05:47.378
You know, it's like, hey, Rick,

00:05:47.378 --> 00:05:49.630
you know I think you've got
talent oozing out of your eyes,

00:05:49.630 --> 00:05:52.337
