delivering on the hustle,

00:05:52.337 --> 00:05:54.130
which is an important variable here.

00:05:54.130 --> 00:05:55.652
What am I doing wrong?

00:05:55.652 --> 00:05:57.131
What is Vayner doing wrong?

00:05:57.131 --> 00:05:59.047
Instead of saying, Rick,
you're lazy, you suck.

00:05:59.047 --> 00:06:00.325
You have to put the onus on you.

00:06:00.325 --> 00:06:01.914
When you're a leader, when you're a CEO,

00:06:01.914 --> 00:06:03.925
when you're the organization, it's on you.

00:06:03.925 --> 00:06:05.878
You're creating the rules of the game.

00:06:05.878 --> 00:06:08.697
If you don't like how
it's played, change it.

00:06:11.177 --> 00:06:12.768
You like that one?

00:06:12.768 --> 00:06:13.884
Took that in.

00:06:13.884 --> 00:06:15.441
