00:06:33.075 --> 00:06:34.309
- Mmm, I sent you this one,

00:06:34.309 --> 00:06:35.556
because this one was challenging to me.

00:06:35.556 --> 00:06:38.216
I mean, look, these are
the two social networks.

00:06:38.216 --> 00:06:41.616
They are the two platforms that
live within a mobile device

00:06:41.616 --> 00:06:43.773
that people are giving their attention to.

00:06:43.773 --> 00:06:45.016
