00:11:11.541 --> 00:11:14.561
- [Voiceover] Matthew asks,
"Do you think custom apps

00:11:14.561 --> 00:11:19.249
"are now, or are becoming,
more crucial to businesses?"

00:11:19.249 --> 00:11:20.388
- Custom apps?

00:11:20.388 --> 00:11:21.181
- [India] Custom apps.

00:11:21.181 --> 00:11:22.323
- I'm not sure what that means, help me.

00:11:22.323 --> 00:11:23.717
- [India] I guess, what
he's meaning is, like

00:11:23.717 --> 00:11:26.170
a business wants to make
an app, like just for them.

00:11:26.170 --> 00:11:27.226
Like maybe a restaurant.

00:11:27.226 --> 00:11:28.255
- Like a VaynerMedia app?

00:11:28.255 --> 00:11:29.448
- [India] Yeah.
- Got it.

00:11:29.448 --> 00:11:31.861
OK, understood, and so
what is the question?

00:11:31.861 --> 00:11:33.343
- [India] If they're becoming more crucial

00:11:33.343 --> 00:11:35.314
and valuable to businesses.

00:11:35.314 --> 00:11:38.953
- This is always a hardcore debate for me.

00:11:41.113 --> 00:11:43.302
Look, the answer is, if
you're a business today,

00:11:43.302 --> 00:11:45.101
going through the next half-decade,

00:11:45.101 --> 00:11:48.315
2016 through 2020, and you have the chops

00:11:48.315 --> 00:11:51.020
to build an incredible
app that people will use,

00:11:51.020 --> 00:11:52.701
like, OK, yes.

00:11:52.701 --> 00:11:55.601
My belief is that that's
far and few between

00:11:55.601 --> 00:11:58.952
for even the Fortune
500 companies, let alone

00:11:58.952 --> 00:12:03.538
Rick's Lobster Roll stand in
St Louis, Missouri, right?

00:12:03.538 --> 00:12:06.714
So I think the answer's
yes, but the commitment

00:12:06.714 --> 00:12:08.322
and dollar amount and energy

00:12:08.322 --> 00:12:11.088
that needs to be deployed
to building a consumer app

00:12:11.088 --> 00:12:13.825
that actually brings value to individuals

00:12:13.825 --> 00:12:16.147
is very, very, very difficult.

00:12:16.147 --> 00:12:18.424
I mean, even things that
are hardcore utilities,

00:12:18.424 --> 00:12:20.718
like banking apps, like,

00:12:20.718 --> 00:12:23.043
are doing well, but, you know,

00:12:23.043 --> 00:12:25.131
not as well as if you
really think about it,

00:12:25.131 --> 00:12:27.729
just hard, it's really, really hard.

00:12:27.729 --> 00:12:31.871
So I would say, for the
97% that are watching here,

00:12:31.871 --> 00:12:34.502
I would not recommend building
an app for your business.

00:12:34.502 --> 00:12:36.570
Because I just don't think you'll build,

00:12:36.570 --> 00:12:38.276
you won't be able to have the right ratio

00:12:38.276 --> 00:12:40.169
of the cost of it,

00:12:40.169 --> 00:12:43.410
yeah, it's kind of like, you know what,

00:12:43.410 --> 00:12:48.397
it's kind of like web
dot com 1996, 95, 97, 98,

00:12:48.397 --> 00:12:50.187
I was there, a lot of people spent

00:12:50.187 --> 00:12:52.658
50, 100,000 dollars on
building their website,

00:12:52.658 --> 00:12:54.766
that their website didn't
bring them any value,

00:12:54.766 --> 00:12:56.287
because they didn't make
a good enough website,

00:12:56.287 --> 00:12:58.752
there wasn't enough
demand for their website.

00:12:58.752 --> 00:13:02.374
I know it's happening now,
and I can see it getting worse

00:13:02.374 --> 00:13:07.001
in the small, mid-sized
business world of building apps.

00:13:07.964 --> 00:13:10.150
- [Voiceover] Ari asks, do
you think it's necessary

00:13:10.150 --> 00:13:12.696
to learn the rules before
you can break them?

00:13:16.221 --> 00:13:18.223
- That's a really good question.

00:13:20.182 --> 00:13:22.925
I think the answer is no.

00:13:22.925 --> 00:13:27.039
But I think you do need
to pick up the rules

00:13:27.039 --> 00:13:31.394
as you go, in the beginning,
to then break them.

00:13:31.394 --> 00:13:34.919
I think it's OK to break
the rules with naiveté,

00:13:34.919 --> 00:13:37.183
and I think, I'm thinking
about VaynerMedia,

00:13:37.183 --> 00:13:40.124
I didn't know anything about
the rules of the agency world.

00:13:40.124 --> 00:13:42.181
And I was breaking them without knowing

00:13:42.181 --> 00:13:44.834
that I was breaking them,
and then as I picked them up,

00:13:44.834 --> 00:13:46.899
for the last four years,
I continued to break

00:13:46.899 --> 00:13:48.948
the ones that I wanted to break,

00:13:48.948 --> 00:13:51.054
and I also learned quite a
bit from the first 18 months

00:13:51.054 --> 00:13:52.037
when I didn't know.

00:13:52.037 --> 00:13:54.503
If I knew the rules when I
first started VaynerMedia,

00:13:54.503 --> 00:13:56.270
I don't think that we would have innovated

00:13:56.270 --> 00:13:58.467
just as much as we actually did.

00:13:58.467 --> 00:14:00.241
So in a weird way, I would actually say

00:14:00.241 --> 00:14:01.936
knowing the rules up front,

00:14:01.936 --> 00:14:03.687
same thing with the wine
business, and dot com,

00:14:03.687 --> 00:14:05.410
I'm actually gonna go
with a different way.

00:14:05.410 --> 00:14:07.768
I often talk about naive
eyes, not knowing anything.

00:14:07.768 --> 00:14:10.775
I think the really great
pattern is not knowing

00:14:10.775 --> 00:14:13.018
but then I respect the game,

00:14:13.018 --> 00:14:14.593
I respect the advertising industry,

00:14:14.593 --> 00:14:16.104
I don't just say, oh, we do it better.

00:14:16.104 --> 00:14:18.186
I watch, I learn, I pay attention.

00:14:18.186 --> 00:14:20.438
And so it's fresh, naive eyes up front.

00:14:20.438 --> 00:14:21.949
Don't know the rules, break them

00:14:21.949 --> 00:14:23.494
because you don't even
know you're breaking them.

00:14:23.494 --> 00:14:25.710
And then, as you mature
into year two, three,

00:14:25.710 --> 00:14:27.504
four, five, six, into your journey,

00:14:27.504 --> 00:14:28.960
start picking up the rules,

00:14:28.960 --> 00:14:30.489
and then continue to break the ones

00:14:30.489 --> 00:14:32.414
that you think are worth breaking.

00:14:32.414 --> 00:14:34.592
Especially because what you
learn in the first 18 months

00:14:34.592 --> 00:14:36.104
of not knowing the rules

00:14:36.104 --> 00:14:37.594
will allow you to make
really smart decisions

00:14:37.594 --> 00:14:42.814
of which rules to break,
over months 19 through 72.

00:14:42.824 --> 00:14:45.126
Mmm.
- [India] Mm-hmm.

